{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106089","id":2498532496,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6U7JSQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106089","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106089.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106089.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106089","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106089/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106089/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106089/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/31b90246e77816c84f2bee8fc40a1e67faabd307","number":106089,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix empty lines being added for errors with no script backtrace","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"#91006 introduced a minor regression with how errors are printed for the case where there are no script backtraces, where they now add empty lines after the `at:` part, one for every registered script language:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Expected Image data size of 256x256x1 (DXT5 RGBA8 with 8 mipmaps) = 87408 bytes, got 87360 bytes instead.\r\n   at: initialize_data (./core/io/image.cpp:2230)\r\n\r\nERROR: Invalid image: image is empty\r\n   at: create_from_image (./scene/resources/image_texture.cpp:77)\r\n\r\nERROR: Failed loading resource: res://broken.dds. Make sure resources have been imported by opening the project in the editor at least once.\r\n   at: _load (./core/io/resource_loader.cpp:342)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes that by checking whether the backtraces are empty before printing them, in all the relevant places.\r\n\r\nNote that this could also be fixed in a less intrusive way, by simply changing `Engine.capture_script_backtraces` to not include empty backtraces at all, but I'm personally of the opinion that a backtrace should always be returned for every registered script language, to clearly indicate that there are indeed no stack frames for that particular script language.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubu